 each gap.","x":0.49999999690003366,"y":0.63063439068102178,"h":0.014714446410113879,"w":0.43478260040283195},{"h":0.014607679465776235,"text":"How to avoid common sports injuries","w":0.35434780120849602,"x":0.49782610234865049,"y":0.66569282175909672},{"x":0.49989126930861305,"y":0.68416874605250722,"w":0.39588756561279292,"h":0.013739066848372672,"text":"To many people, doing sports means occasionally getting"},{"text":"injured. But, you can do several things to help you avoid","y":0.69908180284351684,"w":0.39130432128906245,"h":0.013127499311316626,"x":0.50000001776126568},{"text":"getting a common sports injury.","h":0.014634371201860619,"x":0.49782609027269442,"y":0.71366279068260474,"w":0.22391304016113278},{"text":"Firstly, it's important to warm up so 1","x":0.50217392287019136,"y":0.72954924877055771,"w":0.25869564056396477,"h":0.013355592654424098},{"x":0.82821687416631173,"y":0.73242262157347504,"w":0.06965320587158208,"text":"to slowly","h":0.010445454681854982},{"text":"raise the heartbeat and warm the muscles. This should be","w":0.4021739196777343,"h":0.010203537041436395,"x":0.50000000070461104,"y":0.74563953487714218},{"x":0.50000000399999989,"text":"for a minimum of ten minutes and at lower intensity than","w":0.40000000000000002,"y":0.76001669432160113,"h":0.01178563098875629},{"y":0.77462437398495099,"h":0.01171283491067765,"x":0.50000001680708295,"w":0.40217388153076172,"text":"your main sporting activity. Next, focus on your technique"},{"w":0.3760869598388672,"x":0.49999999520737803,"y":0.78923205339391267,"text":"Many sports injuries are the result of doing something","h":0.013093528047029901},{"h":0.015988372204100765,"text":"wrong. Understand fully what you are doing ?","w":0.32173912048339837,"x":0.49782609488873564,"y":0.80087209280783334},{"x":0.49999999500000003,"w":0.40000000000000002,"y":0.818313953773945,"h":0.011819602253043016,"text":"avoid making mistakes. An experienced trainer is required"},{"w":0.09247549057006843,"h":0.013087438621584679,"text":"early on so 3","x":0.49956509250526038,"y":0.83094620646305273},{"h":0.011627906550947142,"text":"_you don't learn bad habits.","w":0.20000000000000007,"x":0.64999999739130454,"y":0.83284883761599926},{"text":"After your training, you need to warm down. This stage","w":0.38478260040283196,"h":0.011751659326441954,"y":0.85016694503914791,"x":0.50000000895619257},{"text":"of your routine is important so as 4","y":0.86337209324245334,"w":0.25652173995971672,"h":0.013088674895552432,"x":0.50000000386072119},{"y":0.86477462421167517,"text":"to suffer","w":0.076086955070495566,"h":0.011686143572621099,"x":0.80434782554446249},{"y":0.8793604652419682,"x":0.50000001318731946,"w":0.40652172088623051,"h":0.011707982157228014,"text":"from sore muscles the next day. Like the warm-up, take 10"},{"x":0.50217391532203559,"text":"minutes in 5","y":0.89098837220902249,"h":0.011766218780874249,"w":0.086956520080566424},{"x":0.65869565866814905,"y":0.89389534899196832,"w":0.23478260040283205,"text":"to allow your heartbeat and body","h":0.011780777837278822},{"x":0.4999999933314227,"w":0.40217391967773436,"h":0.010184124435526742,"y":0.90843023265572731,"text":"temperature to return to normal. And finally, relax. A tired"},{"h":0.013081394571294758,"x":0.50217391745948703,"y":0.9215116280777248,"text":"body is more likely to pick up an injury, so be sure your body","w":0.41956520080566406},{"h":0.011783204214003695,"y":0.93604651184080567,"text":"is well-rested before the next exercise session.","w":0.32391304016113287,"x":0.50000000705711456},{"h":0.011627906550947031,"x":0.90000000036864503,"text":"81","w":0.023913042545318675,"y":0.96511627922452636}]